❗️ Last night, the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continued to launch group strikes by air-based high-precision weapons and drones at the ports of Ukraine and vessels engaged in delivering cargo to the Armed Forces of Ukraine.

📍 The following targets were eliminated in the port of Yuzhny, Odessa region:

▪️ a tanker delivering petrol, oil, and lubricants to the AFU;

▪️ five tanks with fuel for the Armed Forces of Ukraine on the territory of a POL depot;

▪️ 10 depots with military equipment on the territory of a logistics terminal;

▪️ port infrastructure facilities used for unloading and storing military cargo.

💥 In addition, the PS-330 Adzhalik electrical substation (28 km north-west of Odessa), which enabled the functioning of the port of Yuzhny, was hit.

🔹Russian Defence Ministry

